### Temu 订单接口测试

@temuAccessToken = uplv3hfyt5kcwoymrgnajnbl1ow5qxlz4sqhev6hl3xosz5dejrtyl2jre7
@shopId = 1
@regionId = 211

### 同步订单到本地
POST {{baseUrl}}/temu/order/sync
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}

{
  "shopId": {{shopId}},
  "site": "US",
  "accessToken": "{{temuAccessToken}}",
  "parentOrderStatus": 4,
  "regionId": {{regionId}},
  "pageNumber": 1,
  "pageSize": 5
}

### 查询本地订单分页
GET {{baseUrl}}/temu/order/page?shopId={{shopId}}&pageNo=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}
